<p class="status"><b>PERMANENT RULE (Glenn 2026-10-13): when this file passes 150 KB (or ~1,000 rendered lines), move completed / stale entries that no longer need referencing, verbatim, to <code>to-do-archive.html</code> (new dated section at its end); keep open items, current results and ideas here. Before the 10-13 pass it was 291 KB / ~2,300 rendered lines.</b></p>

